  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support Our Amazon Youth Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Our Amazon Youth Project works in remote communities of the Peruvian Amazon. We run capacity-building and personal development workshops for 400 young people aged 15-18 years old. We are also training 30 educators on topics of sexual and reproductive health, cultural identity and vocational skills, while providing higher education scholarships and a Youth Hub for 11 students. Our goal is to empower resilient young people who will contribute to a sustainable future for the Amazon region.</narrative>
  </description>
